      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Just wanted to make sure we recognize all the work @RebelMike and @Essen have made creating this Run's CoB\nNow with:\n- More sane orientation\n- Pin 1 Fiducial\n- Overall better routing and yield improvements\n- Anti-reverse element *there is a hole you can add a pin header to ensure CoB orienation*\n\nThanks guys!",
